{"obsah":"<p>The motorcyclists' ball near Mělník was genuine old-school fun in an old but well-preserved gym that looked like it came straight out of a film from the 70s/80s. Martin Šimůnek and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček went along to entertain the locals. </p>\n\n<p>It was also Martin's premiere on his new bike, as he returned to a 26” machine after 10 years. At the end of the almost 30-minute show, one more gauntlet was thrown down: ride down the stage and the obstacles on a Babeta moped :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2Fatt.-SbUdo1Pv8S-HLoXw5L3w6wzcmGCgWimrjVn3sZGYog.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2Fatt.-SbUdo1Pv8S-HLoXw5L3w6wzcmGCgWimrjVn3sZGYog.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250517\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2Fatt.5ldVGXhGRfmBL2EN58sZjrAg1fMXJSidg_9ETAWcjn8.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2Fatt.5ldVGXhGRfmBL2EN58sZjrAg1fMXJSidg_9ETAWcjn8.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250518\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2Fatt.axsRfstMXV2-tK_jhVUsLJLUyEHoW5VKJSSOfryO1ws.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2Fatt.axsRfstMXV2-tK_jhVUsLJLUyEHoW5VKJSSOfryO1ws.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2505